{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fe2d641c63880c943b210d3723401038dfa69890710e65d729039754273b9f52", "ja": "（新しい衣装に着替えた麗花は、クルクルと\n部屋の中を動きまわっている。楽しそうだな）", "zh": "（换上新服装的丽花，正在房间里转来转去地走动。看起来很开心嘛。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "9c4607a12f66333a7c454c23b8fef0cd003197c0fd1368f41442f9bb4c5b60bb", "ja": "キラキラでかわいい、サマーな衣装～。\n夏と言ったら、やっぱりキラかわ☆ですね♪", "zh": "闪闪发亮又可爱的夏日服装～  \n说到夏天，果然还是闪亮可爱☆呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "62ea4f80117ca3698613bb8d3c1eeac4a82425253c97469a74e0dbb17793b767", "ja": "でも！　重要なモノが、何か足りないと思いませんか？\n答えをどうぞ、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "但是！你不觉得还缺少某个重要的东西吗？\n请说出答案，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e173d32778da33bfb6209f832696a38a537cb9a5a1f11b85a23ede45cbf3f179", "ja": "えっ！　急に？\nそうだな……う～ん……。", "zh": "诶！突然来这一出？\n是啊……嗯……艰难抉择……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "31a7811613f6f724ef6eb73cb6741123797afc11542d42faa35b8dc4fc64b357", "ja": "ぶっぶー！　時間切れです。", "zh": "错——！时间到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8ed53f46bc85e938e5123a946d75d2a3c0afad4bd4c7281871fa5efa45afc05e", "ja": "（早いっ！　でもスムーズな進行だ！）", "zh": "（真快！不过流程推进得很顺利！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "38f5d20465d09b549577a2ffe423ae079535e5b1f3f95425b7369df3e8613a9a", "ja": "答えは～……{$P$}さんでした～♪\nぱちぱちぱちぱちぱち～♪", "zh": "答案是～……{$P$}先生～♪\n啪啪啪——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "897aa975c833297e131658f56e762bc676d2ecd00bf983a0c69b9302f0fbc5e7", "ja": "というわけで、さっそく準備はいいですか？\n忘れ物をしたら、取りに帰る時間はありませんよ？", "zh": "那么，准备好了吗？要是忘带东西，可就没时间回去取了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1008_p", "source_sha256": "633736922944039bacc3e4345802b96598a3bb0e6203615e1cc1c0b979d6cf8f", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと待ってくれ！\nとりあえず、何の準備が必要か教えてくれないか？", "zh": "等、等一下！\n先告诉我需要准备什么，行不行？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "f1b12ec15930e049933ec9376cc18959e8abdf77154df426d18c4f591f773c62", "ja": "もちろん、夏にやってみたいことの準備です！", "zh": "当然是为夏天想做的事情准备啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7bcde4da9cf945fc0a02b30a287f07f994294850cb37f48a31cac5eb68ca1f4b", "ja": "なるほど…………。\nもう少し詳しく。", "zh": "原来如此…………\n再详细说说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "3494734938af5f588821ca6778410ec88429307ee40b2648edef6980aa3754f3", "ja": "ふふ、とっても簡単ですよ♪　夏っぽい衣装を\n着てるから、思いきり弾けちゃおうってことです！", "zh": "呵呵，非常简单哦♪因为穿着很有夏日气息的服装，所以要尽情释放自己！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "0256a9adfaeea48fdb88ccd53d9cf7ef556c8b507ca07a3543bb6206b654e4da", "ja": "でも一人でそういうことをすると、驚かれることが\n多いので、私と一緒に弾けてくださいね♪", "zh": "不过，一个人那样做的话，经常会让人吃惊，所以请和我一起尽情释放吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1013_p", "source_sha256": "790af345da23088d134b48b10bbc5f6268cecb468cc57d196a48e4837d154f68", "ja": "やりたいことはなんとなくわかったが、試着の後に\nしないか？　一旦、その話は置いといて……。", "zh": "你想要做的事我大概明白了，不过能等试穿完\n之后再做吗？先暂时搁下那个话题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "10ba89015e61fefa36c63d40428fc7de97ecd32d2e0b436740da2c9b666bdbf1", "ja": "お　き　ま　せ　ー　ん　♪", "zh": "叫　醒　不　来　哦——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "2a532112fbebe48968721f60e2d5b095e0a18f1dcbb193a6ae8e6228e5be235f", "ja": "明るくて、かわいくて、楽しい気持ちになって……\nこの衣装の良さを広めるためにも必要なことなんです！", "zh": "既明亮、又可爱，还能让人心情愉快……\n为了让大家了解这套服装的优点，这些都是必不可少的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "ec04c0d19ebd2430a45ea8fa7b857cc6598f6c9889a54e9c110cdb110e4313ae", "ja": "ファンの人達には、もちろん公演で伝えますけど、\n{$P$}さんにも感じてほしいなぁ～。", "zh": "当然也会在公演中传达给粉丝们，不过，我也希望{$P$}先生能感受到呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1018_p", "source_sha256": "9222b49042a5ff142ddea4d479b1e2d61fde60a592d3e07353831c86943f0f1f", "ja": "……そこまで言われると、断るのは野暮だな。\nわかったよ、一緒に思いきりハジケよう！", "zh": "……话都说到这份上了，拒绝就太不解风情了呢。\n我知道了，一起尽情狂欢吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "d87b9ae9bb2ff36dc7e300b2f6a84b6159a89dfe97a398552a5690ce2fc658df", "ja": "さっすが、夏デューサーさん！\n私と一緒に、このまま飛び出しちゃいましょう♪", "zh": "不愧是夏制作人！\n和我一起就这样冲出去吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "e19603d0909c78923153b9d6396e16019fc79026d67b55b922ec44dff2a19812", "ja": "何をするかは、まだ決めてませんけど。\nきっと、何をしても楽しめちゃいますよね♪", "zh": "虽然还没决定要做什么。\n但不管做什么，一定都能玩得开心吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1021_p", "source_sha256": "d06f740d7bf5089b03d20536b59edb4a015927f8ad2292a722826ebd750e0ceb", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\n案外、勢いでなんとかなるかもしれないし……。", "zh": "啊，说得也是。\n说不定凭着一股冲劲就能想办法解决呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1022_048rei", "source_sha256": "e6c15562c29099242812a5883a49f8331626cedfac22da01af624d10bb1345b8", "ja": "それではそれでは。『キラかわサマー楽しみ隊』\n結成です！　夏を目指して、レッツゴー！", "zh": "那么那么。“闪亮可爱夏日期待队”\n成立！朝着夏天，出发！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0534_1023_p", "source_sha256": "d859bac0b903bad9f8dddf88759fc54f9edd05ae4bb5928404bbb418645ade0a", "ja": "ゴー！　……って、劇場の中でいいのか？\nその衣装のまま外に出るのはダメだからな？　麗花ー！", "zh": "冲啊！……等等，在剧场里面没问题吗？\n你不能就穿着那身衣服跑到外面去啊？　丽花——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
